== Attacks and abilities ==
{{For|strategies for defeating Fulings|Aggressive creature strategies#Fuling}}
Besides the spear, which can only be thrown, each weapon arcs horizontally by 90 degrees and extends 2.4 meters out.

=== Club ===
Does 85 [[Damage types#Blunt|Blunt]] damage. This attack has a 2-second cooldown and can be used within 1.6 meters of a player.

=== Spear ===
Throws a spear at the player, which does not need to be retrieved for Fulings to attack again (85 [[Damage types#Pierce|Pierce]] damage). The spear travels at 20 meters per second for up to 10 seconds before despawning and has a spread of 4–20 degrees. This has a 4-second cooldown and can be used within 14 meters of a player.

=== Sword ===
Does 85 [[Damage types#Slash|Slash]] damage. This attack has a 2-second cooldown and can be used within 1.6 meters of a player.

=== Torch ===
Does 45 [[Damage types#Blunt|Blunt]] and 45 [[Damage types#Fire|Fire]] damage, which applies the [[Burning]] status. This attack has a 2-second cooldown and can be used within 1.6 meters of a player.

